  _pageType: 0
  _text: My first job was in an accounting firm in Rouen. I handled invoices and
    balance sheets for small businesses. It was routine, but I liked the order of
    the numbers. I met Marie there, a colleague who became my wife. We got married
    in 1975, a simple ceremony with our families.
  _texture: {fileID: 0}
